    core_synastry: `Your Sun forms a sextile to their Mercury, 60 degrees of productive exchange between your identity and how they think. They perceive you with clarity but not overwhelming focus. You experience their mind as something that can understand you without needing to define you. The sextile means their thinking and your sense of self are compatible without being fused. They can articulate who you are without making you into a project. You can be yourself without their mental processes feeling intrusive.`,
