    friendship_synastry: `They understand you well enough to be helpful without understanding you so completely that you feel dissected. You interest their mind without exhausting it. These friendships often involve good conversation that doesn't need to be constant. The distance the sextile provides means both of you can think about other things without the friendship feeling neglected.`,
    romantic_synastry: `They articulate you accurately without making you into their intellectual project. You give their mind real substance to work with without needing to be the only thing they think about. The relationship benefits from having verbal intimacy available without it being the relationship's only register. The sextile provides enough distance that both of you can think about the relationship without every thought becoming a referendum on whether it's working.`,
