    core_synastry: `Your Sun forms a trine to their Mercury, 120 degrees of natural flow in the same elemental family. They perceive you with ease and clarity. You experience their mind as something that gets you without effort. The trine means their thinking and your sense of self are drawing from the same source. They articulate who you are in ways that feel accurate and comfortable. You show up in ways their mind can process without struggle.`,
