    core_synastry: `Your Sun opposes their Mercury, 180 degrees across the chart. They perceive you from maximum distance. You experience their mind as something that sees you clearly but from outside your experience rather than inside it. The opposition means their thinking and your sense of self pull in fundamentally different directions. They articulate who you are from a perspective you don't occupy. You show up in ways their mind can observe but not fully inhabit.`,
