    core_synastry: `Your Moon meets their Mercury at the same degree. What you feel arrives at the precise frequency of how they perceive, think, and articulate. They can name what you're feeling before you've found the words yourself. You experience their mind as something that reads your emotional state with unusual accuracy. This is one of the most emotionally legible aspects in synastry. It often feels like being understood at the feeling level without having to explain.`,
    behavioral_synastry: `They notice what you're feeling before you've said anything. They put words to your emotional state in ways you recognize as accurate. You give their mind real emotional content to work with. Your feelings become something they can think about, describe, and reflect back to you. The shadow is that their articulation of your feelings can sometimes arrive before you've finished having the feeling, which can feel like your emotional experience is being processed for you rather than with you. The work is making sure their words serve your feelings rather than replace them.`,
    friendship_synastry: `They can describe what you're feeling to you. They're the friend who says what you're going through before you've managed to say it yourself. You're the one whose emotional life gives their mind something genuinely worth turning over. These friendships often involve conversations where feelings get named and understood in ways that feel clarifying rather than invasive.`,
    romantic_synastry: `You feel articulated by them at the emotional level. They encounter you as someone whose feelings give every conversation real emotional content. Emotional intimacy and verbal intimacy are the same thing in this relationship. The sustaining work is making sure you also learn to articulate their emotional life rather than simply being the one whose feelings get articulated.`,
