    behavioral: `Because your thinking and your aesthetic sense have some breathing room from each other, you can reflect on what you value without it triggering aesthetic crisis. You can think critically about art, relationships, and meaning without losing your capacity to find things beautiful. The sextile means intellectual clarity and aesthetic appreciation can work together productively. You can talk about beauty and the talking enhances rather than diminishes the experience. This produces cultural intelligence that others experience as genuine rather than performative.`,
